 "teaching": "Sage rulers employ the intelligent without exalting them; an ordered government wants an ordered country, where a natural sanity arises if it isn't interfered with (Cleary's notes to Tao Te Ching, Chapter 3).",
 "caption_y": 0.73,
 "phrases": [
  "“Not exalting | *cleverness",
  "causes the people | not to *contend.”",
  "“Here, *cleverness | is used in the sense",
  "of *cunning | and craft,",
  "such as sought by | *contending lords",
  "hoping to learn | the ways",
  "of *aggrandizing | themselves",
  "and enlarging | their *holdings.”",
  "Sound *familiar?",
  "“Taoist philosophers | did not believe",
  "that it was a | *good sign for society",
  "when cunning | *intellectuals",
  "were *competing | for the attention",
  "of the rich | and *powerful.”",
  "“Su Che, | who is a *statesman",
  "as well as a | *poet and mystic,",
  "presents | *another view",
  "of this passage | and the following",
  "passage that | it introduces.”",
  "“It is not that | *sage rulers",
  "don't employ | the *intelligent,",
  "only that they | don't *exalt them.",
  "They don't throw away | goods that are *hard to find,",
  "they just don't put | *high prices on them.",
  "They don't get rid of | whatever is *desirable,",
  "they just | don't *see it.”",
  "They just don't | pay *attention to it.",
  "“Thus, the intelligent | are *employed,",
  "but the people | don't *compete.",
  "Rare goods and | *desirable things",
  "are after all | in *plain view,",
  "but theft, | *robbery,",
  "and malicious | *disturbance",
  "do not *rise.”",
  "So, if you have | an *ordered government,",
  "what they would | want to create",
  "is an | *ordered country.",
  "If you have | an ordered country,",
  "there's a | *natural sanity",
  "that if you | don't *interfere with it,",
  "it just *arises.",
  "And people don't go | *breaking into",
  "each other's | cars and houses",
  "and killing them | and *robbing them",
  "and all that | other stuff.",
  "There's a | *general sense that,",
  "hey, that's not how | we do things *around here.",
  "And it's | very clear",
  "that even if | there is not",
  "an economic or a | political *collapse,",
  "even if there's not | geopolitical *catastrophe,",
  "we're going to need | to *rebuild this country.",
  "~You ~know, I've been in | *child welfare",
  "and | *juvenile justice",
  "for a very | *large chunk of my life,",
  "probably | *half of it.",
  "And things have just gone | completely *off the rails.",
  "And so we | can't do that",
  "with our | *own children,",
  "because | if we do,",
  "what we're going to | end up with is,",
  "those are | the people",
  "who are going to be | *taking care of us,",
  "taking care | of *you.",
  "So you've got to have | within your cohort",
  "*sane people",
  "that are | *willing to work",
  "for the | *good of the people,",
  "the *commonweal.",
  "Or it's going to | come back and *bite you",
  "sooner | or later."
 ],
